_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:49:05Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Yes. I chuckled when I  heard it.", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:49:07Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "So ferguson? Fergie farzi?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": true, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:49:09Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Hahahahahahhaa", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:49:11Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Nice one", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:49:13Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Epic troll", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:49:14Z", "username": "Farhan", "text": "Fergie to farzi - a history of ManU", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:49:56Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Fergie time - basically how the whistle would never really get blown as per clock and give united time to try and find a winner / equaliser", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:51:07Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "https://www.goal.com/en-in/news/what-is-fergie-time-manchester-uniteds-history-of-late-goals/iqs4qho529891hykg171hhtbc", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:52:21Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "That’s because of that 1999 final?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:52:21Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Here. With some stats for you", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:52:31Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Where they scored 3 goals in 1 minute or some such?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:53:02Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Naah. Started even before that. When in 92 / 93 a really generous period was added", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:55:26Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "This seems to suggest Liverpool hv scored more fergie goals?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:55:35Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "As a proportion?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:56:15Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "When the refs could be easily bullied 😅🙈", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:56:46Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Yeah. If you go by pure stats. But the actual gripe is that when only 2 minutes had to be given United would get 4-5 minutes and even then whistle would be blown only after 6-7 minutes", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:56:50Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Because better club 😅", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:57:17Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Or because United had all but sealed the game in regulation time. 😏", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T17:57:33Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "That was 3 goals in 6 in Istanbul 🙈", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T18:00:12Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "There was a journalists poll about greatest footballing manager moments a few years back that I had read. The 2005 pipped the 1999 one. And the explanation was - takes some real tactical know how to mar a defensive change when you are already 3 goals down and chasing the game", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T18:00:37Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "That was 2006 na?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T18:00:38Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Or 5", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T18:00:43Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "I was in school", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T18:00:45Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "The 1999 one changes were throw everything you’ve got", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T18:00:45Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "And against a clearly better team 😅", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T18:01:12Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "We had djimi traore for Maldini 🙈", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T18:44:36Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Yeah only gerrard was notable", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-05T18:44:45Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "And that old guy scored the goal in the first minute no", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]